                "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndata = np.array([\n    [1, 2, 3],\n    [4, 5, 6],\n])\n\ncolumn_means = data.mean(axis=0)\nrow_sums = data.sum(axis=1)\n\n# column_means -> [2.5, 3.5, 4.5]\n# row_sums     -> [6, 15]",
